    "created_at": "2018-01-10T11:58:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-10T11:58:03Z",
    "body": "As for specification location, a more logical fit might be https://github.com/whatwg/storage including `navigator.storage` as a point to hang these APIs of.\r\n\r\nMy main concern here is with prompting the user on behalf of a third-party. I'd really like us to move to a world where all UI prompts come from a place that matches the address bar. \"I'm on example.com, why do I get a prompt from \"elsewhere.example?\" is real problematic and not something we should further enshrine.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
