    "created_at": "2018-01-10T14:31:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-10T14:31:39Z",
    "body": "I contemplated navigator but since 1) storage is only granted to this document and 2) it changes document.cookie, I felt document was a better fit.\r\n\r\nA prompt may be phrased as having to do with both the third and first party — “Would you like to use payment.com under store.com?”\r\n   How would the browser otherwise get informed consent from the user, assuming it has decided it needs to ask?",
