    "created_at": "2018-01-10T16:23:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-10T16:23:53Z",
    "body": "If this is not meant to cover all storage, please don't name the API using \"storage\".\r\n\r\nPersonally, it seems to me this permission should probably apply to all storage since users don't really understand the difference between cookies and other storage.\r\n\r\nIt would be helpful to have an example prompt that seems understandable to users.",
